This directory can be used with either lxcu-project-tmp or
chroot-project-tmp to install build dependencies of this project in the
container or chroot.

The install.txt files can appear either at distribution or release level,
ie:-

Either project-root
		|------	build-depends
				|------	debian
					|------	install.txt

or	project-root
		|------	build-depends
				|------	debian
					|------	trixie
						|------	install.txt

